        "text": {
            "description_html": "<a name=\"LAU-EDGE-PULL-PC\"><b>Laurey Edge Pull in Polished Chrome</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Polished Chrome Edge Pull installs with a low profile that will add a modern touch to your kitchen. The Edge Pull in Polished Chrome can be mounted horizontally or vertically for use on kitchen cabinet doors or drawers. Choose from an array of sizes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Laurey Polished Chrome  Cabinet Edge Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Polished Chrome </li>\r\n<li>Package with 2 Self Tap Screws - 1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 5 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>LAU-96726:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-13/20\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LAU-96226:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 3-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-13/20\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LAU-96326:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 5-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 5-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-13/20\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LAU-96426:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 8-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 8-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-13/20\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LAU-96526:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 11-22/25\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-13/20\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
